The decision model derives from cross-encoder/ms-marco-MiniLM-L6-v2,
published by the Sentence Transformers project under Apache License 2.0.
Spunto fine-tunes its encoder and adds a learned projection and recurrent
routing head. The released FP32 ONNX graphs preserve those trained weights.
https://huggingface.co/cross-encoder/ms-marco-MiniLM-L6-v2

The retrieval model is an FP32 ONNX export of the unchanged pretrained
sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2, published by the Sentence Transformers
project under Apache License 2.0.
https://huggingface.co/sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2

Training used distillation from Qwen/Qwen3-Reranker-0.6B, published by the
Qwen team under Apache License 2.0. Teacher weights are not distributed.
https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-Reranker-0.6B
